(* Beginning of Notebook Content *)
Notebook[{
Cell["API MNA — DC, AC e domínio s", "Section"],

Cell["Laboratório Virtual de Circuitos — API MNA completa (DC, AC e domínio s)\n\nEste notebook substitui IC_1905.nb. Não é um patch: a primeira célula de código é o programa inteiro.\n\nComo publicar\n1. Abra este arquivo no Wolfram (File → Open, ou arraste o .nb).\n2. Coloque o cursor na primeira célula de código (as definições) e avalie com Shift+Enter. A saída deve ser a frase \"Definicoes da API carregadas...\".\n3. Avalie a célula de testes. Confira: o divisor DC traz o nó 2 em 5 V; o RC no modo S devolve uma expressão em s (sem erro); o capacitor sem v(0) e a fonte H sem Alvo falham com mensagem em português.\n4. Só então avalie a célula CloudDeploy. Ela republica o objeto público simulador-circuitos-api-v2, o mesmo endereço que o site já usa. DC e AC continuam nesse objeto.\n5. Não avalie o CloudDeploy antes dos testes: a publicação substitui a API que está no ar.\n\nO site (GitHub Pages) já envia Config.Modo = \"S\". Enquanto esta célula não for publicada, o site avisa que a nuvem ainda não devolveu expressões simbólicas e não mostra números de DC como se fossem Laplace.\n\nContrato: veja wolfram/CONTRATO-S.md no repositório.", "Text"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
"(* ============================================================",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"   Laboratório Virtual de Circuitos — API MNA",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"   Arquivo completo para CloudDeploy (substitui IC_1905.nb).",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"   Modos em Config[\"Modo\"]:",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"     \"DC\"  — regime permanente contínuo (C aberto, L curto)",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"     \"AC\"  — fasores em jω (Z_C = 1/(jωC), Z_L = jωL)",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"     \"S\"   — domínio s / Laplace",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"   No modo S os tipos Capacitor e Inductor NÃO mudam.",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"   A substituição acontece só aqui, na montagem das equações:",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"     capacitor:  v(n1)-v(n2) = i/(s C) + v(0)/s",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"                 (impedância 1/(sC) em série com fonte v(0)/s)",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"     indutor:    v(n1)-v(n2) = (s L) i - L i(0)",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"                 (impedância sL em série com fonte -L i(0))",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"   Fontes independentes aceitam Laplace: degrau A/s, impulso A,",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"   exponencial A/(s+α) com α de e^{-α t}.",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"   Avalie ESTA célula inteira. Depois avalie a célula de testes",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"   e, só então, a célula CloudDeploy.",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"   ============================================================ *)",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"parseValue[val_String] := ToExpression[val];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"parseValue[val_] := val;",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"cleanTeX[expr_] := StringReplace[ToString[expr, TeXForm], {",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  \"$\\\\_$\" -> \"_\",",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  \"\\\\text{i}\" -> \"i\",",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  \"\\\\text{v}\" -> \"v\",",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  \"\\\\text{\" -> \"\",",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  \"}\" -> \"\"",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"}];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"fmtNum[x_] := Module[{v = N[x], e, m, s},",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  If[Abs[v] < 10^-12, \"0\",",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    e = Floor[Log10[Abs[v]]];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    m = Round[Abs[v]*10^(5 - e)];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    If[m >= 10^6, m = Round[m/10]; e = e + 1];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    s = IntegerString[m];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    If[v < 0, \"-\", \"\"] <> StringTake[s, 1] <> \".\" <> StringDrop[s, 1] <> \"e\" <> ToString[e]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  ]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"formatResult[val_, modo_] := Module[{num = N[val], mag, ang},",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  If[modo == \"AC\",",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    If[Abs[num] < 10^-12, \"0\",",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      mag = fmtNum[Abs[num]];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      ang = Round[Arg[num]/Degree, 0.01];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      mag <> \" \\[Angle] \" <> ToString[ang] <> \"\\[Degree]\"",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    ],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    fmtNum[Re[Chop[num]]]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  ]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"(* Número vindo do JSON: string já expandida pelo site (\"100*0.001\"),",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"   número, ou vazio. Não interpreta sufixo \"m\"/\"k\" — o frontend faz isso. *)",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"campoNumerico[v_] := Which[",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  v === \"\" || v === Null || MissingQ[v], 0,",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  StringQ[v], Quiet[Check[parseValue[v], 0]],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  NumericQ[v], v,",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  True, Quiet[Check[parseValue[ToString[v, InputForm]], 0]]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"noValidoQ[n_] := NumericQ[n] && n >= 0 && Round[n] == n;",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"normalizarModo[m_] := Module[{u = ToUpperCase[StringTrim[ToString[m]]]},",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  Which[",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    u == \"AC\", \"AC\",",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    u == \"S\" || u == \"LAPLACE\" || u == \"S-DOMINIO\" || u == \"SDOMINIO\", \"S\",",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    True, \"DC\"",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  ]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"normalizarLaplace[tipo_] := Module[{u = ToLowerCase[StringTrim[ToString[tipo]]]},",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  Switch[u,",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    \"step\" | \"u\" | \"degrau\", \"degrau\",",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    \"impulse\" | \"delta\" | \"impulso\", \"impulso\",",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    \"exp\" | \"exponential\" | \"exponencial\", \"exponencial\",",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    _, \"degrau\"",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  ]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"(* A/s , A  ou  A/(s+α). α é o coeficiente de e^{-α t}. *)",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"laplaceFonte[comp_Association] := Module[{lap, tipo, amp, alpha},",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  lap = Lookup[comp, \"Laplace\", <||>];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  If[!AssociationQ[lap], lap = <||>];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  tipo = normalizarLaplace[Lookup[lap, \"Tipo\", \"degrau\"]];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  amp = campoNumerico[Lookup[lap, \"Amplitude\", Lookup[comp, \"Valor\", Lookup[comp, \"Modulo\", 0]]]];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  alpha = campoNumerico[Lookup[lap, \"Alpha\", 0]];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  Switch[tipo,",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    \"impulso\", amp,",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    \"exponencial\", amp/(s + alpha),",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    _, amp/s",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  ]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"valorFonte[comp_Association, modo_String] := Which[",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  modo == \"AC\",",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    parseValue[ToString[comp[\"Modulo\"]]] * Exp[I * parseValue[ToString[comp[\"Fase\"]]] * Degree],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  modo == \"S\",",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    laplaceFonte[comp],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  True,",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    parseValue[ToString[comp[\"Valor\"]]]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"(* Mesmas frases do frontend (sdominio.js). Só corre no modo S. *)",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"validarDominioS[components_List] := Module[",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  {erros = {}, contagem = <||>, nome, tipo, nos, alvo, ic, pinos, faltando, n, k},",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  Do[",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    nos = Lookup[comp, \"Nos\", {}];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    Do[",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      If[noValidoQ[n],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"        k = Round[n];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"        contagem[k] = Lookup[contagem, k, 0] + 1",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      ],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      {n, nos}",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    ],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    {comp, components}",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  ];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  Do[",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    nome = ToString[Lookup[comp, \"Componente\", \"componente\"]];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    tipo = ToString[Lookup[comp, \"Tipo\", \"\"]];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    nos = Lookup[comp, \"Nos\", {}];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    If[tipo == \"Capacitor\" || tipo == \"Inductor\",",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      ic = Lookup[comp, \"CondicaoInicial\", Missing[\"KeyAbsent\", \"CondicaoInicial\"]];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      If[StringQ[ic], ic = StringTrim[ic]];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      If[MissingQ[ic] || ic === \"\" || ic === Null,",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"        If[tipo == \"Capacitor\",",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"          AppendTo[erros, \"O capacitor \" <> nome <> \" está sem a condição inicial v(0). Informe a tensão inicial; use 0 se ele começa descarregado.\"],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"          AppendTo[erros, \"O indutor \" <> nome <> \" está sem a condição inicial i(0). Informe a corrente inicial; use 0 se ele começa sem corrente.\"]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"        ],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"        Module[{parsed = If[NumericQ[ic], ic, Quiet[Check[parseValue[ToString[ic]], $Failed]]]},",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"          If[!NumericQ[parsed],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            If[tipo == \"Capacitor\",",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"              AppendTo[erros, \"A condição inicial v(0) do capacitor \" <> nome <> \" não é um número válido.\"],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"              AppendTo[erros, \"A condição inicial i(0) do indutor \" <> nome <> \" não é um número válido.\"]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            ]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"          ]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"        ]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      ]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    ];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    If[tipo == \"CCVS\" || tipo == \"CCCS\",",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      alvo = StringTrim[ToString[Lookup[comp, \"Alvo\", \"\"]]];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      If[alvo == \"\" || alvo == \"Null\",",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"        AppendTo[erros, \"A fonte \" <> nome <> \" (\" <> If[tipo == \"CCVS\", \"H\", \"F\"] <> \") está sem referência de controle. Informe o Alvo: o nome do componente cuja corrente comanda essa fonte.\"],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"        If[alvo == nome,",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"          AppendTo[erros, \"A fonte \" <> nome <> \" (\" <> If[tipo == \"CCVS\", \"H\", \"F\"] <> \") não pode usar a si mesma como referência de controle.\"],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"          If[!MemberQ[components, c_ /; ToString[Lookup[c, \"Componente\", \"\"]] == alvo && c =!= comp],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            AppendTo[erros, \"A fonte \" <> nome <> \" (\" <> If[tipo == \"CCVS\", \"H\", \"F\"] <> \") aponta para \\\"\" <> alvo <> \"\\\", mas não há componente com esse nome. A referência de controle não foi resolvida.\"]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"          ]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"        ]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      ]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    ];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    If[tipo == \"VCVS\" || tipo == \"VCCS\",",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      pinos = {\"Ctrl+\", \"Ctrl−\"};",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      faltando = {};",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      Do[",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"        n = If[Length[nos] >= i, nos[[i]], Missing[]];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"        If[!noValidoQ[n] || (Round[n] =!= 0 && Lookup[contagem, Round[n], 0] < 2),",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"          AppendTo[faltando, pinos[[i - 2]]]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"        ],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"        {i, 3, 4}",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      ];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      If[faltando =!= {},",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"        AppendTo[erros,",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"          \"A fonte \" <> nome <> \" (\" <> If[tipo == \"VCVS\", \"E\", \"G\"] <>",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"          \") está sem a referência de controle resolvida (\" <> StringRiffle[faltando, \" e \"] <>",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"          \"). Conecte os dois pinos de controle a nós do circuito; o terra é o nó 0.\"",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"        ]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      ]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    ],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    {comp, components}",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  ];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  erros",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"pacoteSimbolico[expr_] := Module[{simp},",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  simp = TimeConstrained[Simplify[Together[expr]], 4, Together[expr]];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  simp = Quiet[Check[Chop[simp], simp]];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  <|\"simp\" -> simp, \"Expressao\" -> ToString[simp, InputForm], \"ExpressaoTeX\" -> ToString[simp, TeXForm]|>",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"amostraTemporal[expr_] := Module[",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  {simp, inv, den, raizes, sigmas, freqs, tmax, nPts = 81, ts, ys, pares, tt, re},",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  simp = Together[expr];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  inv = TimeConstrained[InverseLaplaceTransform[simp, s, t], 4, $Failed];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  If[inv === $Failed || Head[inv] === InverseLaplaceTransform, Return[Null]];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  den = Denominator[simp];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  raizes = Quiet[Check[",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    If[PolynomialQ[den, s] && Exponent[den, s] > 0, s /. NSolve[den == 0, s], {}],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    {}",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  ]];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  raizes = Select[Flatten[{raizes}], NumericQ];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  sigmas = Cases[raizes, r_ /; Re[r] < -10^-8 :> -Re[r]];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  freqs = Cases[raizes, r_ /; Abs[Im[r]] > 10^-8 :> Abs[Im[r]]];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  tmax = Which[",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    sigmas =!= {} && freqs =!= {}, Max[6/Min[sigmas], 3*2*Pi/Min[freqs]],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    sigmas =!= {}, 6/Min[sigmas],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    freqs =!= {}, 4*2*Pi/Min[freqs],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    True, 1.",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  ];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  tmax = Clip[tmax, {10^-6, 20.}];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  ts = Range[0, nPts - 1]*tmax/(nPts - 1);",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  ys = Table[",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    re = Quiet[Check[Re[Chop[N[inv /. t -> tt]]], $Failed]];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    If[NumericQ[re], re, $Failed],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    {tt, ts}",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  ];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  pares = If[MemberQ[ys, $Failed] || Max[Abs[ys]] > 10^9, Null, MapThread[{#1, #2} &, {ts, ys}]];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  <|",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    \"Expressao\" -> ToString[inv, InputForm],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    \"ExpressaoTeX\" -> ToString[inv, TeXForm],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    \"Amostras\" -> If[ListQ[pares], pares, {}]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  |>",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"resultadoNumerico[local_String, expr_, modo_String, unidade_String] := <|",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  \"Local\" -> local,",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  \"ValorNumerico\" -> formatResult[expr, modo],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  \"Unidade\" -> unidade",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"|>;",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"resultadoSimbolico[local_String, expr_, unidade_String] := Module[{pac, item, tempo},",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  pac = pacoteSimbolico[expr];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  item = <|",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    \"Local\" -> local,",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    \"ValorNumerico\" -> pac[\"Expressao\"],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    \"Expressao\" -> pac[\"Expressao\"],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    \"ExpressaoTeX\" -> pac[\"ExpressaoTeX\"],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    \"Unidade\" -> unidade",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  |>;",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  tempo = amostraTemporal[pac[\"simp\"]];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  If[AssociationQ[tempo], item[\"Tempo\"] = tempo];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  item",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"processCircuit[payloadStr_String] := Module[",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  {result, payload, config, components, modo, freq, omega, nodes, eqs, vars,",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"   solSym, currentVars, response, compVal, srcVal, n1, n2, ctrl1, ctrl2,",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"   indepSources, stepEqs, stepSol, superposicao, hasDependentOrReactive,",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"   subs, aviso, v0, i0, nomeC, errosS, eqStrings, eqTeX, resultados, comp, n, cv, src},",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  Clear[v, i, s, t];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  result = Catch[",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    payload = Check[ImportString[payloadStr, \"RawJSON\"], Throw[<|\"Erro\" -> \"Falha ao ler JSON.\"|>]];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    If[!KeyExistsQ[payload, \"Config\"] || !KeyExistsQ[payload, \"Netlist\"],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      Throw[<|\"Erro\" -> \"Formato de payload inválido (Falta Config ou Netlist).\"|>]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    ];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    config = payload[\"Config\"];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    components = payload[\"Netlist\"];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    modo = normalizarModo[config[\"Modo\"]];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    If[!ListQ[components] || Length[components] == 0,",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      Throw[<|\"Erro\" -> \"O circuito está vazio.\"|>]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    ];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    freq = If[KeyExistsQ[config, \"Frequencia\"], parseValue[ToString[config[\"Frequencia\"]]], 60];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    omega = 2*Pi*freq;",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    If[modo == \"S\",",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      errosS = validarDominioS[components];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      If[errosS =!= {}, Throw[<|\"Erro\" -> StringRiffle[errosS, \" \"]|>]]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    ];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    nodes = Check[",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      DeleteDuplicates[Flatten[Map[#[\"Nos\"] &, components]]],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      Throw[<|\"Erro\" -> \"Falha na extração dos nós.\"|>]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    ];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    nodes = Select[nodes, # != 0 &];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    eqs = {};",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    currentVars = {};",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    subs = {};",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    v[0] = 0;",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    Check[",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      Do[",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"        AppendTo[eqs, Sum[Which[",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"          comp[\"Tipo\"] == \"Transformer\" && comp[\"Nos\"][[1]] == n, i[comp[\"Componente\"] <> \"_p\"],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"          comp[\"Tipo\"] == \"Transformer\" && comp[\"Nos\"][[2]] == n, -i[comp[\"Componente\"] <> \"_p\"],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"          comp[\"Tipo\"] == \"Transformer\" && comp[\"Nos\"][[3]] == n, i[comp[\"Componente\"] <> \"_s\"],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"          comp[\"Tipo\"] == \"Transformer\" && comp[\"Nos\"][[4]] == n, -i[comp[\"Componente\"] <> \"_s\"],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"          comp[\"Nos\"][[1]] == n, i[comp[\"Componente\"]],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"          comp[\"Nos\"][[2]] == n, -i[comp[\"Componente\"]],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"          True, 0",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"        ], {comp, components}] == 0],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"        {n, nodes}",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      ],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      Throw[<|\"Erro\" -> \"Falha na montagem da LCK.\"|>]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    ];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    Check[",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      Do[",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"        n1 = comp[\"Nos\"][[1]];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"        n2 = comp[\"Nos\"][[2]];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"        nomeC = comp[\"Componente\"];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"        Switch[comp[\"Tipo\"],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"          \"Resistor\",",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            compVal = parseValue[ToString[comp[\"Valor\"]]];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            AppendTo[eqs, v[n1] - v[n2] == compVal * i[nomeC]];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            AppendTo[currentVars, i[nomeC]],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"          \"VoltageSource\",",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            srcVal = valorFonte[comp, modo];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            AppendTo[eqs, v[n1] - v[n2] == srcVal];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            AppendTo[currentVars, i[nomeC]],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"          \"CurrentSource\",",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            srcVal = valorFonte[comp, modo];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            AppendTo[eqs, i[nomeC] == srcVal];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            AppendTo[currentVars, i[nomeC]],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"          \"Capacitor\",",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            compVal = parseValue[ToString[comp[\"Valor\"]]];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            Which[",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"              modo == \"AC\",",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"                AppendTo[eqs, v[n1] - v[n2] == (1/(I*omega*compVal)) * i[nomeC]],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"              modo == \"S\",",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"                v0 = campoNumerico[comp[\"CondicaoInicial\"]];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"                (* 1/(sC) em série com a fonte v(0)/s *)",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"                AppendTo[eqs, v[n1] - v[n2] == i[nomeC]/(s*compVal) + v0/s];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"                AppendTo[subs, <|",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"                  \"Componente\" -> nomeC, \"Tipo\" -> \"Capacitor\",",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"                  \"Impedancia\" -> \"1/(s*C)\", \"FonteSerie\" -> \"v(0)/s\",",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"                  \"CondicaoInicial\" -> ToString[v0, InputForm]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"                |>],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"              True,",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"                AppendTo[eqs, i[nomeC] == 0]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            ];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            AppendTo[currentVars, i[nomeC]],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"          \"Inductor\",",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            compVal = parseValue[ToString[comp[\"Valor\"]]];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            Which[",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"              modo == \"AC\",",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"                AppendTo[eqs, v[n1] - v[n2] == (I*omega*compVal) * i[nomeC]],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"              modo == \"S\",",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"                i0 = campoNumerico[comp[\"CondicaoInicial\"]];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"                (* sL em série com a fonte -L i(0) *)",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"                AppendTo[eqs, v[n1] - v[n2] == (s*compVal)*i[nomeC] - compVal*i0];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"                AppendTo[subs, <|",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"                  \"Componente\" -> nomeC, \"Tipo\" -> \"Inductor\",",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"                  \"Impedancia\" -> \"s*L\", \"FonteSerie\" -> \"-L*i(0)\",",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"                  \"CondicaoInicial\" -> ToString[i0, InputForm]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"                |>],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"              True,",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"                AppendTo[eqs, v[n1] - v[n2] == 0]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            ];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            AppendTo[currentVars, i[nomeC]],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"          \"VCVS\",",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            compVal = parseValue[ToString[comp[\"Valor\"]]];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            ctrl1 = comp[\"Nos\"][[3]];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            ctrl2 = comp[\"Nos\"][[4]];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            AppendTo[eqs, v[n1] - v[n2] == compVal * (v[ctrl1] - v[ctrl2])];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            AppendTo[currentVars, i[nomeC]],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"          \"VCCS\",",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            compVal = parseValue[ToString[comp[\"Valor\"]]];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            ctrl1 = comp[\"Nos\"][[3]];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            ctrl2 = comp[\"Nos\"][[4]];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            AppendTo[eqs, i[nomeC] == compVal * (v[ctrl1] - v[ctrl2])];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            AppendTo[currentVars, i[nomeC]],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"          \"CCVS\",",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            compVal = parseValue[ToString[comp[\"Valor\"]]];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            AppendTo[eqs, v[n1] - v[n2] == compVal * i[comp[\"Alvo\"]]];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            AppendTo[currentVars, i[nomeC]],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"          \"CCCS\",",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            compVal = parseValue[ToString[comp[\"Valor\"]]];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            AppendTo[eqs, i[nomeC] == compVal * i[comp[\"Alvo\"]]];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            AppendTo[currentVars, i[nomeC]],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"          \"Transformer\",",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            compVal = parseValue[ToString[comp[\"Razao\"]]];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            AppendTo[eqs, v[n1] - v[n2] == compVal * (v[comp[\"Nos\"][[3]]] - v[comp[\"Nos\"][[4]]])];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            AppendTo[eqs, i[nomeC <> \"_s\"] == -compVal * i[nomeC <> \"_p\"]];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            AppendTo[currentVars, i[nomeC <> \"_p\"]];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            AppendTo[currentVars, i[nomeC <> \"_s\"]],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"          _,",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            Throw[<|\"Erro\" -> \"Tipo de componente desconhecido: \" <> ToString[comp[\"Tipo\"]] <> \".\"|>]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"        ],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"        {comp, components}",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      ],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      Throw[<|\"Erro\" -> \"Falha nas equações dos componentes.\"|>]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    ];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    vars = Join[Table[v[n], {n, nodes}], currentVars];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    solSym = Check[Solve[eqs, vars], Throw[<|\"Erro\" -> \"Falha na resolução da matriz.\"|>]];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    If[Length[solSym] > 0 && modo == \"S\" && !FreeQ[solSym[[1]], C],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      Throw[<|\"Erro\" -> \"Sistema singular. Frequência de ressonância perigosa ou curto.\"|>]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    ];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    If[Length[solSym] > 0,",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      indepSources = Select[components, MemberQ[{\"VoltageSource\", \"CurrentSource\"}, #[\"Tipo\"]] &];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      hasDependentOrReactive = Length[Select[components, MemberQ[{",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"        \"VCVS\", \"VCCS\", \"CCVS\", \"CCCS\", \"Capacitor\", \"Inductor\", \"Transformer\"",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      }, #[\"Tipo\"]] &]] > 0;",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      superposicao = {};",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      If[modo =!= \"S\" && !hasDependentOrReactive && Length[indepSources] > 1,",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"        Do[",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"          stepEqs = {};",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"          Do[",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            AppendTo[stepEqs, Sum[Which[",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"              comp[\"Nos\"][[1]] == n, i[comp[\"Componente\"]],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"              comp[\"Nos\"][[2]] == n, -i[comp[\"Componente\"]],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"              True, 0",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            ], {comp, components}] == 0],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            {n, nodes}",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"          ];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"          Do[",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            Switch[comp[\"Tipo\"],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"              \"Resistor\",",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"                compVal = parseValue[ToString[comp[\"Valor\"]]];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"                AppendTo[stepEqs, v[comp[\"Nos\"][[1]]] - v[comp[\"Nos\"][[2]]] == compVal * i[comp[\"Componente\"]]],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"              \"VoltageSource\",",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"                srcVal = valorFonte[comp, modo];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"                If[comp[\"Componente\"] == src[\"Componente\"],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"                  AppendTo[stepEqs, v[comp[\"Nos\"][[1]]] - v[comp[\"Nos\"][[2]]] == srcVal],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"                  AppendTo[stepEqs, v[comp[\"Nos\"][[1]]] - v[comp[\"Nos\"][[2]]] == 0]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"                ],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"              \"CurrentSource\",",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"                srcVal = valorFonte[comp, modo];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"                If[comp[\"Componente\"] == src[\"Componente\"],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"                  AppendTo[stepEqs, i[comp[\"Componente\"]] == srcVal],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"                  AppendTo[stepEqs, i[comp[\"Componente\"]] == 0]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"                ]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            ],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            {comp, components}",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"          ];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"          stepSol = Solve[stepEqs, vars];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"          If[Length[stepSol] > 0,",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            AppendTo[superposicao, <|",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"              \"FonteAtiva\" -> src[\"Componente\"],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"              \"ResultadosParciais\" -> Table[formatResult[v[n] /. stepSol[[1]], modo], {n, nodes}]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            |>]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"          ],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"          {src, indepSources}",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"        ]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      ];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      resultados = Flatten[{",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"        Table[",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"          If[modo == \"S\",",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            resultadoSimbolico[\"Nó \" <> ToString[n], v[n] /. solSym[[1]], \"V\"],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            resultadoNumerico[\"Nó \" <> ToString[n], v[n] /. solSym[[1]], modo, \"V\"]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"          ],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"          {n, nodes}",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"        ],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"        Table[",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"          If[modo == \"S\",",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            resultadoSimbolico[\"Corrente \" <> ToString[cv[[1]]], cv /. solSym[[1]], \"A\"],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            resultadoNumerico[\"Corrente \" <> ToString[cv[[1]]], cv /. solSym[[1]], modo, \"A\"]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"          ],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"          {cv, currentVars}",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"        ]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      }];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      eqStrings = If[modo == \"S\", Table[ToString[eq, InputForm], {eq, eqs}], Table[cleanTeX[eq], {eq, eqs}]];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      response = <|",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"        \"Modo\" -> modo,",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"        \"Equacoes\" -> eqStrings,",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"        \"Superposicao\" -> superposicao,",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"        \"Resultados\" -> resultados,",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"        \"NosLista\" -> nodes",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      |>;",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      If[modo == \"S\",",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"        eqTeX = Table[ToString[eq, TeXForm], {eq, eqs}];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"        response[\"EquacoesTeX\"] = eqTeX;",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"        response[\"Substituicoes\"] = subs;",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"        aviso = \"\";",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"        Module[{nF, nP, nX},",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"          nF = Count[components, c_ /; MemberQ[{\"VoltageSource\", \"CurrentSource\"}, c[\"Tipo\"]]];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"          nP = Count[components, c_ /; MemberQ[{\"Resistor\", \"Capacitor\", \"Inductor\"}, c[\"Tipo\"]]];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"          nX = Length[components] - nF - nP;",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"          If[nF != 1 || nP < 2 || nP > 3 || nX > 0,",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"            aviso = \"Escopo inicial do modo s: uma fonte independente e dois ou três componentes R, L ou C. O sistema foi resolvido mesmo assim.\"",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"          ]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"        ];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"        If[aviso =!= \"\", response[\"Aviso\"] = aviso]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      ];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      response,",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      Throw[<|\"Erro\" -> \"Sistema singular. Frequência de ressonância perigosa ou curto.\"|>]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    ]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  ];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  ExportString[result, \"JSON\"]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"\"Definicoes da API carregadas (DC, AC e S). Avalie a celula de testes e, se o resumo estiver correto, a celula CloudDeploy.\""
 }]], "Input"],

Cell["Testes locais — avalie depois das definições. Não publica nada.", "Subsection"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
"(* Avalie esta célula depois das definições. Ela não publica a API.",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"   O divisor DC deve mostrar o nó 2 igual a 5.00000e0.",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"   O RC em modo S deve ter Modo -> \"S\" e uma expressão com s.",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"   Sem v(0) e sem Alvo devem voltar Erro em português. *)",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"resumir[json_String] := Module[{d},",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  d = ImportString[json, \"RawJSON\"];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  If[KeyExistsQ[d, \"Erro\"],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    <|\"Erro\" -> d[\"Erro\"]|>,",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    <|",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      \"Modo\" -> Lookup[d, \"Modo\", \"\"],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      \"Resultados\" -> Map[",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"        #[\"Local\"] -> Lookup[#, \"Expressao\", Lookup[#, \"ValorNumerico\", \"\"]] &,",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"        d[\"Resultados\"]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      ]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    |>",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  ]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"payloadDC = ExportString[<|",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  \"Config\" -> <|\"Modo\" -> \"DC\", \"Frequencia\" -> 60|>,",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  \"Netlist\" -> {",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    <|\"Componente\" -> \"V1\", \"Tipo\" -> \"VoltageSource\", \"Valor\" -> \"10\", \"Nos\" -> {1, 0}|>,",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    <|\"Componente\" -> \"R1\", \"Tipo\" -> \"Resistor\", \"Valor\" -> \"100\", \"Nos\" -> {1, 2}|>,",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    <|\"Componente\" -> \"R2\", \"Tipo\" -> \"Resistor\", \"Valor\" -> \"100\", \"Nos\" -> {2, 0}|>",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  }",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"|>, \"JSON\"];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"payloadAC = ExportString[<|",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  \"Config\" -> <|\"Modo\" -> \"AC\", \"Frequencia\" -> 60|>,",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  \"Netlist\" -> {",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    <|\"Componente\" -> \"V1\", \"Tipo\" -> \"VoltageSource\", \"Modulo\" -> \"10\", \"Fase\" -> \"0\", \"Nos\" -> {1, 0}|>,",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    <|\"Componente\" -> \"R1\", \"Tipo\" -> \"Resistor\", \"Valor\" -> \"1000\", \"Nos\" -> {1, 2}|>,",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    <|\"Componente\" -> \"C1\", \"Tipo\" -> \"Capacitor\", \"Valor\" -> \"0.000001\", \"Nos\" -> {2, 0}|>",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  }",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"|>, \"JSON\"];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"payloadS = ExportString[<|",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  \"Config\" -> <|\"Modo\" -> \"S\", \"Frequencia\" -> 60|>,",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  \"Netlist\" -> {",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    <|\"Componente\" -> \"V1\", \"Tipo\" -> \"VoltageSource\", \"Valor\" -> \"10\", \"Nos\" -> {1, 0},",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      \"Laplace\" -> <|\"Tipo\" -> \"degrau\", \"Amplitude\" -> \"10\", \"Alpha\" -> \"0\"|>|>,",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    <|\"Componente\" -> \"R1\", \"Tipo\" -> \"Resistor\", \"Valor\" -> \"1\", \"Nos\" -> {1, 2}|>,",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    <|\"Componente\" -> \"C1\", \"Tipo\" -> \"Capacitor\", \"Valor\" -> \"1\", \"Nos\" -> {2, 0}, \"CondicaoInicial\" -> \"0\"|>",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  }",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"|>, \"JSON\"];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"payloadSemIC = ExportString[<|",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  \"Config\" -> <|\"Modo\" -> \"S\"|>,",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  \"Netlist\" -> {",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    <|\"Componente\" -> \"V1\", \"Tipo\" -> \"VoltageSource\", \"Valor\" -> \"10\", \"Nos\" -> {1, 0},",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      \"Laplace\" -> <|\"Tipo\" -> \"degrau\", \"Amplitude\" -> \"10\"|>|>,",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    <|\"Componente\" -> \"R1\", \"Tipo\" -> \"Resistor\", \"Valor\" -> \"1\", \"Nos\" -> {1, 2}|>,",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    <|\"Componente\" -> \"C1\", \"Tipo\" -> \"Capacitor\", \"Valor\" -> \"1\", \"Nos\" -> {2, 0}|>",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  }",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"|>, \"JSON\"];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"payloadSemAlvo = ExportString[<|",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  \"Config\" -> <|\"Modo\" -> \"S\"|>,",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  \"Netlist\" -> {",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    <|\"Componente\" -> \"V1\", \"Tipo\" -> \"VoltageSource\", \"Valor\" -> \"10\", \"Nos\" -> {1, 0},",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"      \"Laplace\" -> <|\"Tipo\" -> \"degrau\", \"Amplitude\" -> \"10\"|>|>,",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    <|\"Componente\" -> \"R1\", \"Tipo\" -> \"Resistor\", \"Valor\" -> \"1\", \"Nos\" -> {1, 0}|>,",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"    <|\"Componente\" -> \"H1\", \"Tipo\" -> \"CCVS\", \"Valor\" -> \"2\", \"Nos\" -> {1, 0}|>",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  }",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"|>, \"JSON\"];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"<|",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  \"DC divisor (nó 2 = 5.00000e0)\" -> resumir[processCircuit[payloadDC]],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  \"AC RC (polar, sem erro)\" -> resumir[processCircuit[payloadAC]],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  \"S RC degrau (expressão em s; vC ~ 10/(s(s+1)))\" -> resumir[processCircuit[payloadS]],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  \"S sem v(0) (deve falhar)\" -> resumir[processCircuit[payloadSemIC]],",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  \"S fonte H sem Alvo (deve falhar)\" -> resumir[processCircuit[payloadSemAlvo]]",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"|>"
 }]], "Input"],

Cell["CloudDeploy — avalie por último. Substitui a API pública simulador-circuitos-api-v2.", "Subsection"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
"(* Avalie por último, depois dos testes.",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"   Republica o MESMO objeto que o site já chama. DC, AC e S vão juntos. *)",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"apiEndpoint = APIFunction[",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  {\"netlist\" -> \"String\"},",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  processCircuit[#netlist] &,",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"  \"String\"",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"];",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"",
"\[IndentingNewLine]",
"CloudDeploy[apiEndpoint, \"simulador-circuitos-api-v2\", Permissions -> \"Public\"]"
 }]], "Input"]
},
WindowSize->{{1400, 900}},
WindowMargins->{{0, Automatic}, {Automatic, 0}},
FrontEndVersion->"14.3 for Microsoft Windows (64-bit) (July 8, 2025)",
StyleDefinitions->"Default.nb"
]
(* End of Notebook Content *)
